# Data manifest discipline (see AGENTS.md and docs/DATA.md)

- Never hardcode absolute data paths in Python; use data_manifest.toml + data_io.resolve/load/save_*.
- Register new datasets in data_manifest.toml before writing code that references them.
- Run `uv run python -m data_io.check` after manifest changes.
- Pipeline outputs must use save_semi_structured or save_parquet (automatic provenance sidecars).
- Use archive-scan / scripts/archive_inbox.sh only for legacy orphan files, not data_io outputs.
- Read PLAN.md at session start; update its data-path table when datasets change.
- Never discard archival metadata fields during transforms.
